🚨🔺️☠️ Planned Pandemics: They told us for years.. and we ignored them.

And his comes after all the previous disease they created - which is all of it❗️

@FollowsTheWhiteRabbit 🐇

Worth adding that this came from a mock-up Trump posted September 27, not an announced plan. The pool is actually still under the floor. It opened in 1933 after the New York Daily News raised money from readers so FDR could swim as therapy for his polio. 

Kennedy swam there daily for his back and in 1962 had the walls painted with a mural of a harbor in St. Croix, which is what you're seeing in this photo. Nixon rarely used it and covered it over in 1970 to make room for the growing TV press corps. So every briefing for 56 years has happened right on top of it.

